   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/auto/new$1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 135,
   "en": "Most of these effects are based on the deployment points value of the ships, which is equal to the ship's base deployment recovery cost, prior to modification by factors such as d-mods.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/auto/new$2.class"
