  },
  {
   "i": 161,
   "en": "Reckless",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/oOOoOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 162,
   "en": "Select personality for this ship",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/oOOoOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 163,
   "en": "Steady",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/oOOoOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 164,
   "en": "supplies to recover",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/oOOoOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 165,
   "en": "Testing",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 166,
   "en": "The maximum arc the shields can cover.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$10.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 167,
   "en": "This ship has no shields.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$10.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 168,
   "en": "When raised, shields gradually fan out to cover their full arc. Shields with a larger maximum arc take longer to open up fully.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$10.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 169,
   "en": "A phase cloak generates hard flux while active.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$11.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 170,
   "en": "However, it will prevent the zero-flux engine boost from activating, and will increase the time it takes for already-built-up flux to dissipate.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$11.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 171,
   "en": "If the maximum flux capacity is exceeded, the ship will overload and de-cloak.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$11.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 172,
   "en": "Keeping shields down unless they're absolutely necessary is key to improving both mobility and damage output.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$11.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 173,
   "en": "Shields generate some soft flux when they're raised even when they're not taking damage.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$11.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 174,
   "en": "The amount of flux is usually less than the ship's dissipation, so this will not cause flux to build up on its own.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$11.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 175,
   "en": "Turning on a phase cloak generates some hard flux.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$12.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 176,
   "en": "A low \"shield flux per damage\" value indicates a more efficient shield capable of absorbing more damage.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$13.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 177,
   "en": "Absorbing damage with shields generates \"hard\" flux, which can not be dissipated while shields are turned on.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$13.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 178,
   "en": "Shields have different efficiency ratings, generating a different amount of flux per point of damage absorbed.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$13.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 179,
   "en": "When a ship exceeds its flux capacity due to taking shield damage, it will overload and become unable to use weapons or defenses until it recovers.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$13.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 180,
   "en": "A ship with a high flux capacity is able to absorb more damage with shields and pour out more weapons fire during a window of opportunity, increasing its short-term effectiveness.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 181,
   "en": "Firing weapons and using shields generates flux.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 182,
   "en": "It may also be more vulnerable while waiting for the built-up flux to dissipate, especially since higher flux capacity often comes at the expense of the dissipation rate.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 183,
   "en": "A ship with higher flux dissipation gets rid of the built-up flux more quickly, increasing its combat effectiveness over the long term.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$3.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 184,
   "en": "Flux is dissipated at double the normal rate while actively venting.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$3.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 185,
   "en": "  Capital ship",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$4.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 186,
   "en": "  Cruiser",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$4.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 187,
   "en": "  Destroyer",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$4.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 188,
   "en": "  Frigate",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$4.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 189,
   "en": "Each vent costs %s ordnance point and increases dissipation by %s flux per second.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$4.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 190,
   "en": "Maximum vents",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$4.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 191,
   "en": "Each capacitor costs %s ordnance point and increases flux capacity by %s.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$5.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 192,
   "en": "Maximum capacitors",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$5.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 193,
   "en": "The maximum speed of this ship under normal combat conditions.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$6.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 194,
   "en": "When a ship's flux is at zero and it's not generating any flux, it receives a bonus of %s to top speed, as well as a boost to turn rate and acceleration.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$6.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 195,
   "en": "Damage that gets through armor and shields gets applied to the hull. Taking hull damage can cause weapons and engines to become temporarily disabled, and is likely to result in casualties among the crew.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$7.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 196,
   "en": "Once hull reaches zero, the ship becomes disabled, though it may be recoverable (by the winner) after the battle ends.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$7.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 197,
   "en": "Armor reduces the damage taken by a percentage that depends on the relative strength of the armor compared to the amount of damage, and blocks damage from getting through to the hull.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$8.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 198,
   "en": "Damage applied in a single hit is much more effective at stripping away armor than the same damage distributed over multiple hits.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$8.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 199,
   "en": "Each hit reduces the amount of armor that remains in the affected area, making each successive hit more and more powerful.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$8.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 200,
   "en": "The \"hit strength\" of beam weapons - which do not score separate hits, but deal damage continuously - is based on their damage/second.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$8.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 201,
   "en": "The effective armor value can not go below %s of its original value, even if it's stripped away entirely, and damage reduction from armor can not exceed %s.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$8.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 202,
   "en": "Firing most weapons (except, generally, missiles) generates flux.",
   "ctx": "starfarer_obf.jar:com/fs/starfarer/coreui/refit/ooOO$9.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 203,
   "en": "Some weapons can fire more and build up more flux over the short term. This value reflects the sustained flux generation that accounts for the rate at which weapons recharge.",
